sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User
    participant Agent as AI Agent App (LangGraph)
    participant OAuth as OAuth2 Server
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant API as API Server (Todo App)

    %% Authentication Phase
    User->>Agent: Provide username & password
    Agent->>OAuth: POST /token (password grant)
    OAuth-->>Agent: Access Token (JWT)

    %% Agent starts a task
    User->>Agent: "Create a new todo item"

    %% Agent calls MCP tool
    Agent->>MCP: MCP Tool Call (create_todo)
    MCP->>MCP: Validate MCP request
    MCP->>API: POST /todos\nAuthorization: Bearer Access Token

    %% API validates token
    API->>OAuth: Validate / introspect token
    OAuth-->>API: Token valid

    %% Business logic
    API->>API: Create Todo item
    API-->>MCP: 201 Created + Todo data
    MCP-->>Agent: MCP Tool Response (Todo created)

    %% Agent responds to user
    Agent-->>User: "✅ Todo created successfully"
